        "category": "taiwan_aviation",
        "headline": "Network Airline Management引進第5架波音747貨機",
        "summary": "Network Airline Management於2026年8月3日宣布，一架前身曾服役於長榮航空與沙烏地阿拉伯航空的波音747-400BCF改裝貨機已於7月加入機隊，成為該公司第5架波音747貨機。該機國籍標誌與登記號碼為9H-AKA，將以比利時列日機場為主要營運樞紐。",
        "headline_en": "Network Airline Management Adds Fifth Boeing 747 Freighter to Fleet",
        "summary_en": "Network Airline Management announced on August 3, 2026, that a fifth Boeing 747-400BCF converted freighter joined its active cargo fleet in July 2026. Registered as 9H-AKA, the 31-year-old aircraft previously flew for EVA Air, Saudia Cargo, and Air Atlanta Icelandic before joining Network Airline Management. Operated by Air Atlanta Europe, the widebody freighter will operate out of its primary hub at Liege Airport in Belgium to help meet strong customer demand for scheduled and charter cargo flights.",
